## Third-Party Software and Assets

AI Go Teacher redistributes or incorporates the following third-party
software, dependencies, and assets. These materials are **not covered by
the license of AI Go Teacher** and remain subject to their respective
licenses.

### KataGo

AI Go Teacher redistributes KataGo as a precompiled binary.

KataGo is licensed under the MIT License.

Copyright 2025 David J. Wu ("lightvector") and contributors.

The full MIT License text for KataGo is available at:

https://github.com/lightvector/KataGo

AI Go Teacher does not claim ownership of KataGo.

### KataGo Third-Party Dependencies

KataGo includes third-party dependencies located in:

`cpp/external/`

Each dependency is licensed under its own respective license.
Please refer to the LICENSE files within those directories.

Additionally:

- `cpp/core/sha2.cpp` contains its own embedded license.
- Some Python files are modified from other open-source projects as noted
  in the source files.

AI Go Teacher does not claim ownership of these third-party dependencies.

### Image Assets

This directory contains image assets used by **AI Go Teacher**. Different assets have different origins and licensing terms. Please refer to the sections below for details.

#### 1. Buttons and Tools

**Directories:** `image/buttons/`, `image/tools/`

These directories contain icons from Google's Material Symbols and/or Material Icons collection.

- **Source:** [Google Fonts Icons](https://fonts.google.com/icons)
- **License:** [Apache License 2.0](https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0)

These icons are subject to the Apache License 2.0 and are not covered by the MIT License of AI Go Teacher.

Some icons may have been modified or adapted for use in this project.

#### 2. Project Logo

**Directory:** `image/logo/`

The logo in this directory was created by the AI Go Teacher project author.

Unless otherwise stated, these logo assets are original works and are licensed under the MIT License of AI Go Teacher.

#### 3. Taijitu Image

**File:** `image/mark/taijitu.png`

- **Source:** [Wikimedia Commons](https://commons.wikimedia.org/)
- **Copyright status:** Public domain, as stated by the original source.

The original work has been released into the public domain by its author. This image is not subject to the MIT License of AI Go Teacher.

Please refer to the original Wikimedia Commons file page for the specific source and public-domain statement.

#### 4. Status Images

**Directory:** `status/`

These images were created using elements from Canva and subsequently edited for use in AI Go Teacher.

- **Source:** [Canva](https://www.canva.com/)

These assets are subject to the applicable Canva content license and terms. They should not be assumed to be independently licensed under the MIT License of AI Go Teacher.

### Audio Assets

AI Go Teacher includes edited audio assets derived from the following
third-party recording:

**"baduk2" by Hongsungbock**

Source:

https://freesound.org/people/Hongsungbock/sounds/840425/

**"Play Go Sounds (SE471) (High Quality)" by MPooman**

Source:

https://freesound.org/people/MPooman/sounds/664986/

The original recording is licensed under the **Creative Commons CC0 1.0
Universal (Public Domain Dedication)**.

License:

https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

The audio included in this project has been cut and edited from the
original recording for use as Go stone placement sound effects in
AI Go Teacher.

The original recording is provided under CC0 1.0 Universal and may be
used, modified, and redistributed in accordance with its license.


